🇺🇸NEW VIDEO: US Reorganizes Forces and Proxies in West Asia + What is "Project Meridian?"

On YouTube: https://youtu.be/c1dfcMJGKFk?si=2Qp7Ti8cmS1vWdkw

▪️the US has only redeployed troops from Iraq to elsewhere in West Asia as part of its ongoing war on Iran; 

▪️the US maintains immense administrative, economic, and covert/proxy military power over Iraq and until that changes, Iraq remains subordinated to/occupied by the US; 

▪️The so-called "Mecca Alliance" is little more than US burden sharing extended over Turkey, Saudi Arabia, and Pakistan; 

▪️It remains to be seen how extensive the "Mecca Alliance" will be mobilized as part of the wider US war on Iran and its network alliance which includes Ansarallah in Yemen; 

▪️US "Project Meridian" is a desperate attempt to leverage technology to reassert US military dominance over the world, but fails to recognize, let alone address the actual systemic problems causing a US decline in the first place;
